<style>
  .credits-page {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
  }
  .credits-page__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  .credits-page__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.88) 100%);
  }

  .credits-page__back {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    left: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-medieval);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    transition: color 0.3s;
    z-index: 10;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
  }
  .credits-page__back:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }

  .credits-page__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    overflow-y: auto;
    max-height: 100vh;
    animation: fadeUp 1.6s ease both;
  }

  /* Ornate divider with Credits label */
  .credits-page__title-ornament {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .credits-page__title-ornament-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .credits-page__title-ornament-label {
    font-family: var(--font-medieval);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.65em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  /* Brand name */
  .credits-page__brand {
    font-family: var(--font-gothic);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.45),
      0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.18),
      0 0 80px rgba(255,255,255,0.08),
      0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,1);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    animation: textGlow 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .credits-page__sub {
    font-family: var(--font-medieval);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.55em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .credits-page__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .credits-page__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-medieval);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.95;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  /* Motto section */
  .credits-page__motto-wrap {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }
  .credits-page__motto-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .credits-page__motto-divider-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .credits-page__motto-divider-diamond {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
  }
  .credits-page__motto {
    font-family: var(--font-gothic);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.5),
      0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,0.2),
      0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,1);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
  }
  .credits-page__motto-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-gothic);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Founder credit */
  .credits-page__founder {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .credits-page__founder-name {
    font-family: var(--font-gothic);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  }
  .credits-page__founder-role {
    font-family: var(--font-medieval);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.45em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .credits-page__content { padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
  }
</style>

<div class="credits-page">
  {%- if section.settings.video_url != blank -%}
    <video class="credits-page__bg" autoplay loop muted playsinline>
      <source src="{{ section.settings.video_url }}" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="credits-page__overlay"></div>

  <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="credits-page__back">&#8592; Return</a>

  <div class="credits-page__content">

    <!-- Ornate divider with Credits label -->
    <div class="credits-page__title-ornament">
      <div class="credits-page__title-ornament-line"></div>
      <span class="credits-page__title-ornament-label">Credits</span>
      <div class="credits-page__title-ornament-line"></div>
    </div>

    <h1 class="credits-page__brand">Obliveyon</h1>
    <p class="credits-page__sub">A database of one.</p>

    <div class="credits-page__body">

      <p>Obliveyon is a reflection of oneself.</p>

      <p>Everything here is an honest attempt at one's inner reflection — the aesthetic, the feeling, the way it looks. Everything is done for a reason. Not to impress, but to become who you were always meant to be. To show that what you carry inside can become something others feel without you saying a word. A path that is recognizable not by telling, but by showing.</p>

      <p>Darkness has always belonged to the wrong side — and it is present. He is changing that. Obliveyon is the opposite, taking something the world sees as dark and turning it into something that points toward God.</p>

      <p>Obliveyon is not about following. It is about the version of yourself you keep putting off — the one God has been calling you to be, fulfilling the destiny He has always promised you, the one only you can fulfill...</p>

      <!-- Motto -->
      <div class="credits-page__motto-wrap">
        <div class="credits-page__motto-divider">
          <div class="credits-page__motto-divider-line"></div>
          <div class="credits-page__motto-divider-diamond"></div>
          <div class="credits-page__motto-divider-line"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="credits-page__motto">Be the light in the darkness.</p>
        <p class="credits-page__motto-sub">Not despite who you are. Because of it.</p>
        <div class="credits-page__motto-divider">
          <div class="credits-page__motto-divider-line"></div>
          <div class="credits-page__motto-divider-diamond"></div>
          <div class="credits-page__motto-divider-line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Founder -->
      <div class="credits-page__founder">
        <p class="credits-page__founder-name">Founded by a Dream</p>
        <p class="credits-page__founder-role">Creator &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Visionary &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Still becoming.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Credits Page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "video_url",
      "label": "Background video URL",
      "info": "Upload your video to Shopify Admin > Content > Files and paste the URL here."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
